---
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Full-stack developer</p>
  <h1 class="headline">
    I build <span class="gradient-text">real-time</span>
    web apps that solve matchmaking and coordination problems.
  </h1>
  <p class="subtext">
    Software engineering student focused on full-stack systems — React/Node
    on the front and back, real-time sockets, and the occasional custom
    matching algorithm.
  </p>
  <div class="actions">
    <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">See my work</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/your-username" class="btn btn-secondary">GitHub</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-purple);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .gradient-text {
    background: var(--gradient-brand);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .subtext {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 34rem;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--gradient-brand);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }
</style>
